{"chunk_id": "c6df3fb1f551", "text": "Arjuna journeys north toward the Himalayas seeking divine weapons, driven by his resolve to avenge the wrongs done to his brothers. Moving with supernatural speed through mountains inhabited by ascetics, he reaches Indrakila where a radiant ascetic halts him and questions why a warrior bears weapons in a realm of peace. The ascetic reveals himself as Indra (Sakra) and offers Arjuna a boon, even suggesting heavenly bliss instead of warfare. Arjuna refuses comfort or paradise, insisting that honor demands he defeat his enemies before enjoying any reward. Impressed by this resolve, Indra tells him he must first win the favor of Shiva to obtain celestial weapons. The narrative then frames the coming episode: Arjuna\u2019s intense austerities and the extraordinary encounter with Shiva that will test and transform him.\nArjuna journeys to the Himalayas seeking celestial weapons; Indra appears disguised as an ascetic and directs him to win Shiva\u2019s favor through austerities.\nThemes: ascetic quest, divine testing, refusal of heavenly pleasure, warrior duty, path to Shiva", "vector": [0.02058204635977745, -0.01638544723391533, -0.014247053302824497, 0.011273347772657871, 0.006020916625857353, 0.03953356668353081, -0.030525580048561096, -0.011968325823545456, -0.018189717084169388, -0.019713323563337326, 0.012897191569209099, 0.007384143304079771, 0.015115775167942047, -0.01022419799119234, 0.004447191953659058, 0.0056299916468560696, 0.0524708516895771, -0.0221724770963192, 0.01332486979663372, -0.010270975530147552, -0.02463163062930107, -0.004016172140836716, 0.006034281570464373, 0.008827559649944305, -0.010317753069102764, 0.003909252118319273, 0.016505731269717216, -0.03605867549777031, 0.005850513465702534, -0.0038190388586372137, -0.012897191569209099, -0.0009614421869628131, 0.004851482342928648, -0.0016037957975640893, -0.034000471234321594, -0.004240035079419613, 0.004219987895339727, -0.031220559030771255, 0.0131778558716